result: 'Created src/driver/sources/dag.rs: ResolutionDag + ResolvedNode types, flatten_workspace()
  recursively assigns PkgId to each member (path-scoped owner_scope), sorts dep hashes
  for determinism, detects identity collisions (same name+scope+version, different
  path) and dependency cycles as hard errors. 4 tests: single root, two distinct sources
  produce distinct hashes, dep included in DAG, missing dep errors. Zero warnings
  (dead_code allowed until threading tasks wire it in). 289 lib tests pass.'
description: Flatten workspace members into a single dependency DAG, assigning PackageIds
  to each member. Detect and report collisions as hard errors. Done when a multi-member
  workspace flattens to one DAG, each member has a distinct PackageId, and collision
  cases produce hard errors verified by tests. Depends on PackageId data structure
  subtask.
